<p>Haye akbar jawa'n, mera jawa'n haye akbar jawa'n..(2)<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma..(2)<br> aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma..(2)<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>1. Guthniyo chalta hua laash talak aa to gaya<br> uski khushbu se mai akbar ka pata paa to gaya<br> dil ki quwat magar is baar mujhe chahiye hai<br> quwat e haider e qarraar mujhe chahiye hai</p> 
<p>aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>2. Humne socha hi kaha'n tha ke ye dina ayega<br> ye mera laal mere saamne mar jayega<br> haal jo dil ka hai amma wo batau kaise<br> naujawani ko zaeefi mein uthau kaise</p> 
<p>aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>3. Haath ka zor gaya dil ki tawanayi gayi<br> hosla toot gaya aankh se beenyi gayi<br> tere shabbir ka ab dil na sambhal payega<br> dum mera saath mein akbar ke nikal jayega</p> 
<p>aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>4. Apni tanhayi ka kya haal batau tumko<br> zakhm e dil khol ke kis tarha dikhau tumko<br> aaj pehlu pe rakha haath utha le amma<br> laash ko mai, mujhe aap sambhale amma</p> 
<p>aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>5. Aap sirhane pe aajaye to kuch haath bate<br> yaa se khaime ka safar amma tere saath kate<br> amma akbar ke jo seene pe nazar padti hai<br> jaise ek aur sina dil mein mere gadhti hai</p> 
<p>aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>6. Haye sehre ki jagah khoon hai mathe pe saja<br> naiza zalim ka hai is chaand se seeene pe laga<br> dil ke armaan ko hai khaak mein milte dekha<br> ediya'n khaak pe hai isko ragadte dekha</p> 
<p>aake maqtal mein mera haath batao amma<br> haath batao amma..<br> laash akbar ki mere saath uthao amma</p> 
<p>7. Bhai abbas jo hota to madad ko aata<br> laasha akbar ka mere saath mein wo uthwata<br> is mere sher ka laasha jo mere haath mein hai<br> amma ab saath mei tum ho ya khuda saath mein hai</p> 
<p>8. Hum likhe jaate hai aur sheh ka karam bolta hai<br> bil yaqee'n dil ki zubaa'n mera qalam bolta hai<br> saari duniya mein raza sahib e tauqeer hu mai<br> nauhakhwani mein sare hazrat e shabbir hu mai</p> 
